'''Otar the Mad''' is one of the eight high-ranked [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priests]] in Skyrim. He is found in [[Skyrim:Ragnvald|Ragnvald]], in a locked coffin before the barrow's [[Skyrim:Word Wall|word wall]]. To get to him, you have to defeat his two keepers&mdash;[[Skyrim:Guardian Torsten|Torsten]] and [[Skyrim:Guardian Saerek|Saerek]]&mdash;and take their skull keys.

He carries his eponymous mask, [[Skyrim:Otar|Otar]], which increases resistance to shock, fire, and frost damage. His weapon is the [[Skyrim:Staff of the Storm Wall|Staff of the Storm Wall]].

Otar knows the following spells: [[Skyrim:Chain Lightning|Chain Lightning]], [[Skyrim:Command Daedra|Command Daedra]], [[Skyrim:Conjure Storm Atronach|Conjure Storm Atronach]], [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]], [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]], [[Skyrim:Lightning Cloak|Lightning Cloak]], and [[Skyrim:Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]].

